ified=1677961028","thumbnailWidth":473,"thumbnailHeight":64},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/full/3938/3938139.svg?modified=1677961028","width":720,"height":92,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/thumbs/3938/3938139.jpg?modified=1677961028","thumbnailWidth":720,"thumbnailHeight":92}],"contributionURL":"","averageRating":4.8889,"reviewCount":2,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/pt-BR/firefox/addon/hexadorsip_steam_2020/reviews/","updateDate":1677966743000},{"id":"{0f4ee068-82d3-4967-ba37-97c990b0d594}","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-32.png","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-64.png","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-128.png"},"name":"Genius Hacker","version":"1.0","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/3413738/genius_hacker-1.0.xpi","homepageURL":null,"supportURL":null,"amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/pt-BR/firefox/addon/genius-hacker/","description":"Congratulations! This is a theme for the heroes who are willing to use their intelligence and power to create a better world! Now, it is the moment of its birth!","fullDescription":"Introductions\nGenius Hacker is a theme that I created for Firefox Browser.\nBackground color of this theme is black, which mimics the background color of terminal. Also the same is the color of toolbar color and popup background, which is black as well.\nMost of the text and icons, such as toolbar icons, toolbar text, popup text and tab highlight, use a vibrant color that symbolizes hackers, the color is green.\nOrange is the color of background tab, it is really very different from green. This heavy and powerful color that used in background tab text could distinguish background tab text from other text and icons.\nThis search bar is wonderful, the color of its text is magenta, which is completely opposite to the color green. The use of magenta could show the position of search bar easier and it is very cooooool. The search bar itself is cool as well, it is translucent with a fantastic color called aqua which looks like the color of the liquid crystal screen.\nYou can change the color of text, background, unvisited links and visited links into green, black, orange and magenta while you are using this theme, that will be very cooooool!\nNotes\nBlack(#000000)\nGreen(#00FF00)\nOrange(#FF7F00)\nMagenta(#FF00FF)\nAqua(#00FFFF)\nStatements\nThis project will not accept any form of donation because it is a theme that only changes the look without any function. I hope you will enjoy it.","weeklyDownloads":77,"type":"theme","creator":{"name":"天之影地之光","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/pt-BR/firefox/user/15238937/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/full/3817/3817205.png?modified=1623029519","width":680,"height":92,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/thumbs/3817/3817205.png?modified=1623029519","thumbnailWidth":473,"thumbnailHeight":64},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/full/3817/3817207.svg?modified=1623029520","width":720,"height":92,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/thumbs/3817/3817207.jpg?modified=1623029520","thumbnailWidth":720,"thumbnailHeight":92}],"contributionURL":"","averageRating":4.6136,"reviewCount":16,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/pt-BR/firefox/addon/genius-hacker/reviews/","updateDate":1569767073000},{"id":"{58735e7b-9eb9-4bbf-aa0d-6bb67d041a96}","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-32.png","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-64.png","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-128.png"},"name":"Hollow Knight Simple","version":"1.0","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/36909